gia 78(4): 522-528. ///-Singer, Rolf. 1986. The Agaricales in Modern Taxonomy 4th Edition. Koeltz Scientific Books, Koenigstein, Germany. 981 pp. ///-Trudell, Steve, Joe Ammirati. 2009. Mushrooms of the Pacific Northwest. Timber Press. 
